<title>EU: Bonino news conference postponed.</title>
<headline>Bonino news conference postponed.</headline>
<text>
<p>Please note the following addition to the Reuters EU diary for Monday, Aug 11:</p>
<p>BRUSSELS (MODIFIED ITEM) - A news conference by European Commissioner Bonino on her trip to Iraq, originally scheduled for Monday, has been postponed until Tuesday.</p>
